@startuml
title Supermarket Management System - Activity Diagram
start
:Admin / employee logs in;
:Update stock, employee and customer details;
:Check stock level and expiry dates;
if (Low stock or nearing expiry?) then (yes)
  :Intimate product status to admin;
  :Reorder or remove product;
else (no)
endif
:Customer selects products at billing;
:Identify customer loyalty card;
if (Loyalty member?) then (yes)
  :Fetch loyalty points and tier;
  :Apply loyalty based offers;
else (no)
endif
:Generate bill;
:Update stock and loyalty points;
:Print bill;
stop
@enduml
